" Free notes on an entry (Emacs' org-add-note, C-c C-z), logged at the top of
" its :LOGBOOK: as "Note taken on".

Given org (note on a headline without a drawer goes after its planning):
  * TODO Meeting
    SCHEDULED: <2026-10-22 jue 20:30>
  Body

Do:
  :call org#note#add()\<CR>Went well\<CR>

Then:
  AssertEqual [
        \ '* TODO Meeting',
        \ '  SCHEDULED: <2026-10-22 jue 20:30>',
        \ '  :LOGBOOK:',
        \ '  - Note taken on ' . Now() . ' \\',
        \ '    Went well',
        \ '  :END:',
        \ 'Body',
        \ ], getline(1, '$')

Given org (note from the body lands on its entry, newest first):
  * TODO Task
    :LOGBOOK:
    - State "TODO"       from "NEXT"       [2026-10-01 jue 10:00]
    :END:
  Body
  * TODO Other

Do:
  G2k:call org#note#add()\<CR>Second\<CR>

Then:
  AssertEqual [
        \ '* TODO Task',
        \ '  :LOGBOOK:',
        \ '  - Note taken on ' . Now() . ' \\',
        \ '    Second',
        \ '  - State "TODO"       from "NEXT"       [2026-10-01 jue 10:00]',
        \ '  :END:',
        \ 'Body',
        \ '* TODO Other',
        \ ], getline(1, '$')

Given org (an empty note writes nothing):
  * TODO Task

Do:
  :call org#note#add()\<CR>\<CR>

Then:
  AssertEqual ['* TODO Task'], getline(1, '$')

Given org (both Emacs' C-c C-z and the leader key add a note):
  * TODO Task

Execute:
  AssertEqual ':OrgAddNote<CR>', maparg('<C-c><C-z>', 'n')
  AssertEqual ':OrgAddNote<CR>', maparg('\z', 'n')
